  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxS_IGv205dFXCRRNwxCiZeR4LopKdZSDvt-pxB5rD16kngdfgT38DPzlF2fyzK3Kwthw/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxS_IGv205dFXCRRNwxCiZeR4LopKdZSDvt-pxB5rD16kngdfgT38DPzlF2fyzK3Kwthw/exec</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"AI 이미지 문제 생성기\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxS_IGv205dFXCRRNwxCiZeR4LopKdZSDvt-pxB5rD16kngdfgT38DPzlF2fyzK3Kwthw/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxS_IGv205dFXCRRNwxCiZeR4LopKdZSDvt-pxB5rD16kngdfgT38DPzlF2fyzK3Kwthw/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxS_IGv205dFXCRRNwxCiZeR4LopKdZSDvt-pxB5rD16kngdfgT38DPzlF2fyzK3Kwthw/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxS_IGv205dFXCRRNwxCiZeR4LopKdZSDvt-pxB5rD16kngdfgT38DPzlF2fyzK3Kwthw/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">AI 이미지 문제 생성기</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>AI 이미지 퀴즈 생성기 </b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #5f6368; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">이미지를 업로드하면 AI가 분석하여</span><br><span style=\"color: #5f6368; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">풀어볼 수 있는 객관식 퀴즈를 만들어 드립니다. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40522d893c6377214c66d1f6471145f6a09b2cb5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40522d893c6377214c66d1f6471145f6a09b2cb5\" data-origin-width=\"941\" data-origin-height=\"661\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">어떤 사진이든 업로드 하고</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이미지에 대한 설명을 간단하게 넣어주고</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">퀴즈 생성하기 누르면</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e340d0d8655a7e091d85b52e7ef7ea5fccc94ccb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e340d0d8655a7e091d85b52e7ef7ea5fccc94ccb\" data-origin-width=\"1034\" data-origin-height=\"819\"></div><p><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">AI(제미나이)가 5지선다형 6개 문항(난이도 상,중,하 2개씩) 만들어 줍니다</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">풀고 나서 채점하기 누르면</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3927899b2e56bdcd60c907c9fc332c3d3a35336e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3927899b2e56bdcd60c907c9fc332c3d3a35336e\" data-origin-width=\"497\" data-origin-height=\"758\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">AI가 채점을 해줍니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
